OL,3,GNEWSAJury considers verdict in         
OL,4,Agrandfather murder trial               
OL,6,FA jury has retired to consider its     
OL,7,Fverdict in the trial of a man accused  
OL,8,Fof murdering a 71-year-old grandfather.
OL,10,FProsecutors allege John Mills, 46, beat
OL,11,FJohn Boyle to death while he was lying 
OL,12,Fin bed at his flat in Kettering,       
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, on 26 October 2025.  
OL,15,FDuring a three-week trial, Mills, of   
OL,16,FMarriott Street in Northampton,        
OL,17,Frepeatedly denied killing Boyle, being 
OL,18,Fpresent at the time of his death or    
OL,19,Fknowing who was responsible.           
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
