OL,3,GNEWSAJury considers verdict in         
OL,4,Agrandfather murder trial               
OL,6,FIn his closing speech, prosecutor      
OL,7,FAndrew Vout KC described the killing as
OL,8,F"a cowardly attack", telling jurors    
OL,9,F"the killer was John Mills." But       
OL,10,Fdefence barrister Jason Bartfeld KC    
OL,11,Fargued there were "other real and clear
OL,12,Fpossibilities" that Mills was not      
OL,13,Fresponsible.                           
